	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "Adi622YK0Tr-o_29q",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 10, DX 10, IQ 7, HT 12, HP 10, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A0xdY6rvrb4VLUsYW",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 12 (offense 9, protection 3), threat tier minor, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "ADDIDDoJ2RMCofxvV",
			"text": "Stench, reach 4 yards: As a Ready maneuver, a dretch may start or stop to exude stench. Any creature that inhales the stench exuded by the dretch in a 4-yard radius becomes nauseated a number of minutes, equal to the margin of failure on its HT roll."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ab9F9Bvru1o3C3ESu",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/dretch.gct"
